window.products.push({"id":1081040,"name":"Dream Loom Solar Powered Mosaic Glass Ball Garden Lights, Color Changing Night Light Rechargeable Table Lamps Waterproof Indoor or Outdoor Lighting fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EpP03uqOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional Solar Outdoor Lanterns 1.Color changing mode ,providing some unique visual experience & awesome decoration to your lawn, garden, patio, yard, etc. 2.Bright white light, can be used as bedroom lamp, washroom lamp etc 3. The glass jar can be used to place small tools like pen or scissor, beautiful decoration at the same time. Setting the mood for your party or a relaxing night outside is easy, simply hang these glass lanterns along the wall, on trees, or use them as a table centerpiece! You and your guests will love the way the colors reflect off of any surface, providing your event with a beautiful light show every time the sun sets. Easy to use: No wiring or any installation for the solar powered outdoor lamp, automatically gets fully charged under the direct sunlight.one button control, easy to operate. Specifications: Material: Mosaic glass Power:0.2W Solar panel voltage: 2V solar panel Current: 120mA NI-MH battery :1.2V NI-MH battery: 600mA LED: 1pcs white led, 1pcs RGB led Switching mode1: white light Switching mode2: colour-changing in RGB Charging time: 10-11 hours Working hours: 8-10 hours Packaging list: 1* color changing garden ball 1* solar panel 1* User manual Warm prompt: 1. Pls tear off the protection film of solar panel for better sunlight absorption before your first use. 2. For making the solar panel work under high efficiency, please keep the panel clean and put it under the direct sunlight as long as possible. 3. Turn the button to Color / Single position to choose RGB or white light. 4.. The ball using the cutting square small glass to complete the design of whole curved surface ,glass edges exists, it's normal phenomenon ,be careful with the edges, so as not to hurt the hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EpP03uqOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dream Loom","source_asin":"B072BL5WTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072BL5WTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072BL5WTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
