window.products.push({"id":1081274,"name":"KLEIN Cold Brew On Tap – 2 Gallon (4 Quart) Large Cold Brew Coffee Maker – Dispenser for Brewing Iced Coffee Concentrate & Infused Tea at Home – 100 M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rh2h69xlL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","description":"INCLUDED: - Stainless steel filter - 2 Gallon Jar - Stainless Steel Spout EASY TO USE 1. Pour coffee grounds into the filter. 2. Filter water through the grounds. 3. steep for 12-24 hours, enjoy! All components are dishwasher safe MAKE CONCETRATED BREW AT HOME The cylindrical wide-bottom design allows for a high ratio of coffee grounds. The more grounds, the richer the concentrate. And as the poet and philosopher Tupac Shakur once wrote, “the blacker the berry, the sweeter the juice.” And we couldn’t agree more. KLEIN COLD BREW Cold Brew Coffee is for those of us who prefer less acid and more flavor. The cold brew process uses time rather than heat to extract oils, sugars, and caffeine from the grounds. The end result is less bitter allowing you to finally bask in Coffee’s truest flavors. Our filter is made from a durable, food grade stainless steel wire, it has a special weave designed to invite yummy goodness from the grounds while keeping them out of our coffee. VERSATILE BREWING KIT The Cold Brew On Tap Kit can brew enough cold brew for any occasion! It can also be used to infuse water with fruits, spices and oils or make sun tea. You can use this system for any type of loose leaf tea. You are only limited by your imagination as the Klein Cold Brew On Tap Kit is perfect for all your cold brew and infusion needs. Click Add to Cart to end your search for the perfect cup!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rh2h69xlL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Klein Industries","source_asin":"B07J1JMLG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J1JMLG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J1JMLG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
