window.products.push({"id":1081284,"name":"Hoop The Ultimate Compost Bin Alternative & Compostable Bags, for Kitchen Organic Waste Collection Compost (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ObYacSkuL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","description":"Hoop is an alternative method of separating organic waste for compost. It is a household product that fits into the trash can you already have and greatly reduces the mess and smell as compared to traditional counter-top bins. Did you know that 37 million tons of organic waste was generated in 2013 in the US alone, and that only 5% of that was actually recycled? Why? Because it is not easy to separate organic waste and so, sadly, it doesn't happen. Hoop makes this process much easier and will help increase the amount of organic waste we recycle and enable a step in the direction of sustainability. >>>>>Here's how it works: Attach Hoop to the rim of your existing trash can. Open Hoop and discard food waste, vegetable trimmings, coffee grounds and any other organic waste. Any spill-over stays in the trash, greatly reducing the mess commonly associated with traditional compost bins. Close Hoop to create a contact seal helping reduce odor and fruit flies. The best part, Hoop in out of sight and not on your kitchen counter! >>>>>Who can use Hoop? Anyone can use Hoop regardless of whether they compost at home or not, and many cities are allowing residents to discard organic waste with yard trimming in their green bins. If you do compost at home, Hoop is perfect for helping make it easy to separate organic waste in-home and carry out to where your compost pile is located. The same is true for residents of cities that allow organic waste to be discarded in the city provided green bins. If neither apply, you can still benefit from reduced kitchen trash odor and reduction of plastic trash bag use by using Hoop to separate organic waste and discard separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ObYacSkuL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoop","source_asin":"B01N0L3Y43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0L3Y43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0L3Y43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
