window.products.push({"id":1081370,"name":"Amelis 2-Tier Cake Stand Pink Confection Display Table Stand with Matt Golden Trims, 2 Ceramic Plates to Serve Cupcakes, Desserts, Pastries, Appetizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HddaQ4GtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High on Elegance: Amelis Luxury Cake Stand has two ceramic plates and a metal stand. The elegant design uses 15% 24K matt golden trim imported from Germany. The perfect dining accessory, it can be an aesthetic centerpiece on your dessert table. Highly recommended for adding a touch of class when you serve cakes, cupcakes, or pastries as a part of brunches, reunions, and tea parties. Create Dining Moments: Whether it is a wedding celebration, birthday party, baby shower, anniversaries, family dinners, or high tea with your friends, you need dining accessories that uplift the table décor. The 2-tier cake stand beautifully displays & serves an assortment of muffins, cookies, finger sandwiches, breads, and other appetizers. Hassle-free Design: The British-style cake stand is easy to de-assemble from a 2-Tier display stand to a stackable, serving stand. Easy to store in your kitchen cupboard/cabinet, the tea cake stand offers sufficient space between the plates, allowing you to arrange & showcase your baked confections. The 2-tiered design conserves space on the table and allows you to arrange different treats. Designed Thoughtfully: Highly functional and ornamental, this table display stand has a lightweight-yet-durable form and the bottom of every part of the stand is frosted to prevent slipping off glossy tablecloths or smooth surfaces. It can be a very thoughtful gift as a part of New Year, Christmas, Mother’s Day, or housewarming celebrations. Product Specifications: Overall height of Amelis 2-tier tea party cake stand is 13.6 inch. Diameter of the top & bottom tiers is 6 and 10 inches respectively. Space between the two tiers measures 4.8 inch. 8.5\" Plate - Dia: 21cm, H: 2.5cm, 10.75\" Plate - Dia: 26.7cm, H: 2.7cm. The ceramic plates are easy to wash by hand, but they are not microwave or dishwasher safe because of the golden trim.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HddaQ4GtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amelis","source_asin":"B09XJBT6XD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XJBT6XD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XJBT6XD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
