window.products.push({"id":1081388,"name":"maifey Shower Caddy No Drilling,Bathroom Shelf Wall Mounted-Shower Shelves with Hooks,Space Aluminum Bathroom Storage Rack-Organizer for Shampoo,Nail-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715d5PCGcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【RUGGED AND DURABLE】 The wall mounted bathroom shelves is made of high-quality thick space aluminum. The surfaceis polished and anodized. It is waterproof, scratch resistant, never rusty, and the surface is long-lasting bright and easy to clean. It can be used for different decorations styled bathroom, shower room, washroom, balcony and other places. 【EASY TO INSTALL】The shower shelf is installed with professional glue(included in the item). Anyone can easily install it by referring to the product manual. Glue installation is more solid than nail-free sticker, and the load capacity is stronger, it can bear 10KG (22 lbs), so you don't have to worry about the shelf falling off. (Painted walls, wallpaper walls, lime walls, cement walls, drywall and other walls cannot be installed with glue, Can be drilled for installation.) 【ABOUT COLOR】 The color of the shower shelf is champagne gold, not the color of gold. The color is more orange than gold. Due to the shooting light and screen display, there is some color difference between the picture display and the product color. The photo was taken in an indoor white light environment. 【SPACE SAVING】 The shower caddy set contains 2 storage units of 325*120*45MM and 4 removable hooks.The shower caddies are installed beside the bathtub, shower or makeup mirror, used to store and organize shampoo, shower gel, soap, facial cleanser , Cosmetics and other toiletries. The hooks can store towels, bath balls, sponges, brushes and other small items. This will make your bathroom more tidy and convenient, allowing you to better enjoy your bath time. 【FREELY COMBINATION】 The two storage organizer of the shower caddy are independent of each other, and can be freely combined according to your needs. The middle and corners of the wall can be installed and used. The hollow design at the bottom of the bathroom shelves can quickly drain and maintain ventilation, keeping the items on the shower shelf dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715d5PCGcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"maifey","source_asin":"B08JHYSNYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JHYSNYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JHYSNYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
