window.products.push({"id":1081532,"name":"Medium Semi Sphere Silicone Mold 2 Packs Baking Mold for Making Hot Chocolate Bomb, Cake, Jelly, Dome Mousse - DIY Cake Mold, Half Ball Sphere Cake Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Cjy9TVwL._AC_SL1160_.jpg","description":"Silicone Mold for Chocolate, Cake, Jelly, Pudding, Round Shape Half Candy Molds Non Stick, BPA Free Silicone Molds for Baking Medium Semi Sphere Silicone Mold, 2 Packs Half Sphere Silicone Baking Molds for Making Chocolate, Cake, Jelly, Dome Mousse Material:Silicone Size: 7.68\"*5.24\"*0.98\" Diameter of each sphere:2.04\" Color :Purple/Brick Red/Pink/Light Blue/Light Green Shape: Silicone Half Ball Mold Package Included:2x Candy & Chocolate Molds TIPS: 🍫1. When you make the cake, please do not pure full cake slurry into the molds, just make it 3/4 full. The cake will expand when making.  🍫2. When you get the molds and first time to make cake or chocolate. First of all, please fill the water in the molds and put into the microwave or oven transfer for 1-2 minutes, then drain 🍫3. When baking, it' s better to put the mold in the flat baking tray as the silicone mold is soft.  🍫4. After baking, please remove the molds out of the oven, and place in the baking rack until the molds completely cooled.  🍫5. Silicone molds can only be used for oven, microwave ovens, and DO not use in gas and fire.  🍫6. Do not use knives or other sharp tolls on silicone molds and avoid stress, pull.  🍫7. Please do not use cool water to scour immediately when it's just taken out of the oven. Just to extend the service life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Cjy9TVwL._AC_SL1160_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thupmuk","source_asin":"B08T8QM9H1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T8QM9H1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T8QM9H1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
