window.products.push({"id":1081588,"name":"Pen Over Sword Extra Long, Oven Mitts, High Heat BBQ Grill Gloves for Baking, Grilling, Oven Use (Dishwasher Safe) - 14\" Long, 2 Gloves (Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6135UrcHv1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Summer is around the corner, which means bbqing with family and friends is about to begin. The smell of juicy burgers, racks of ribs, marinated chicken, and vegetables is about to be rising from your grill. With all that effort you need a pair of bbq gloves that will not only protect your hands from the heat, but your forearms as well. That flame can really do some damage. Our bbq grill gloves feature the following: PROFESSIONAL GRADE HAND AND FOREARM PROTECTION - Our grill and oven gloves are designed to cover the forearms of must adults at an amazing 14\" in length. The protect that hands as well from all direct contact with heat making the perfect glove combination to keep you protected. EXTREME COMFORT AND FLEXIBILITY - No one can master a grill or oven without having the flexibility in their hands to grab pots, pans, trays and more. Our gloves give you the comfort and flexibility you need to master any grill or over meal. UNMATCHED VERSATILITY - Cooking and grilling is an art so you never know what the next meal will bring. Our grill and oven gloves are versatile giving you the ability to move your hands freely. You can pick up wood, move grill racks, move oven racks, shuffle around logs, or anything else you need to do. There are no restrictions. UNPARALLELED RUGGED DURABILITY - No one likes a product that only lasts a few months. That's why we've built our bbq gloves to last. You can use them season after season and meal after meal. STATE-OF-THE-ART DESIGN - Functionality and design must go hand in hand. We've designed our grill gloves with grooves and bumps to make sure you can grip whatever you need to in the moment. Never again will you be struggling to hold your prized meal. 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE -If you aren’t satisfied with your grill gloves, just send them back for a 100% refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6135UrcHv1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pen Over Sword","source_asin":"B019X5FX5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019X5FX5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019X5FX5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
