window.products.push({"id":1081705,"name":"Rada Cutlery Non-Scratch Basting Spoon - Heat Resistant Cooking Utensil – Serving Spoon with Ergonomic Comfort Grip Handle - 13-1/4 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jDP+n3oaS._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Rada Cutlery Non-Scratch Basting Spoon will be a staple in your kitchen. Besides basting meats, this kitchen spoon can be used as a serving spoon, to stir sauces and soups, or to skim liquids and fats while cooking. It’s ultra-versatile, and you’ll find yourself reaching for it routinely while you cook and bake.This basting spoon measures 13-1/4 inches and is made from a BPA-free, black stainless steel resin. This material is heat resistant up to 400 degrees and is safe for use with non-stick pots and pans. The ergonomic comfort-grip handle also has a small hole at the top, so you can hang up the basting spoon when you’re done using it. This cooking utensil is safe to wash in the dishwasher, although hand washing is recommended.Rada Mfg. Co. is located in Waverly, Iowa and has been manufacturing cutlery, kitchen utensils, cookware, and more in the USA since 1948. Our mission is all about “providing our customers the best value of kitchen knives for their dollar.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jDP+n3oaS._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RADA","source_asin":"B082P7JN9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082P7JN9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082P7JN9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
