window.products.push({"id":1081736,"name":"HAPF30AT-Total Air HEPA Type Filter Replacement for Holmes AER1 Air Purifier, Compatible with HAPF30AT and HAP242-NUC (3 HEPA + 6 Carbon Booster Filte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGS6cHUdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【COMPATIBLE MODELS】- ①The premium air purifier filter is specfically compatible with Holmes AER1 Ready Air Purifiers Models CAP531-U, CAP529-U, HAP240, HAP242, HAP412, HAP422, HAP424, HAP706, HAP716, HAP9240, HAP9242, HAP9412, HAP9414, HAP9422, HAP9424,HAP1200 and Bionaire Air Purifier Models BAP260, BAP520, BAP815, BAP825, BAP9200, and BAP9700. Compared to Part # HAPF30AT Air Filter. Replaces A Filter, D Filter, K Filter ❤【SUPER CRAFT】- Our air purifier filter replacement is made of high quality non-woven fabric and activated carbon, both adopt advanced lower energy consumption and lower density structure technology verified by the manufacturer, with higher efficiency and less pressure to ensure maximum filtration. And the upgraded electrostatic electret filter technology which used in true hepa filter ensures energy saving and a longer service life ❤【EXCELLENT FILTRATION】- Our hapf30at-total air hepa type filter combined with high efficiency filtration system is capable of attaching 99.7% of the suspended as small as 0.3 microns, and the activated carbon pre-filter helps you solve the problem of unpleasant odors and gases. It's the ideal and perfect air purifier accessory for fresh air and odor free ❤【COST-EFFECTIVE GOODS】- Package includes 3 x AER1 air filter and 6 x Pre-Cut Activated Carbon Filter. HEPA Filter Dimensions: H: 10.0” x L: 4.6” x W 1.2” and Carbon Filter Dimensions: H: 9.2” x L: 4.2” x W 0.2\". Never waste your time measuring and cutting prefilters again! Our air filter replacement combo set contains all the required filters to complete the standard installation of your air purifier (Please refer to the picture for details) ❤【REPLACEMENT RECYCLE】- We recommend you to replace the filter revery 3-6 months and pre-filter every 2-3 months for optimal performance (depending upon your usage and environment). It is fairly easy to install the filters for air purifier, no tools required. Simply take out and replace from your machine unit when needed ❤【SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE】- Funmit adhere to provide all customers with a simple, streamlined shopping experience of large appliance replacement parts, and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there. We stand by our products, and our customers are our focus as a business. If you have any quality problem, please contact Funmit customer service team in time, and we will try our best to solve your problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGS6cHUdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B08S75ZNRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S75ZNRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S75ZNRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
