window.products.push({"id":1081753,"name":"D215 24\" x 24\" PVC Antique Gold Ceiling Tiles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+IdXeK1kL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ceiling Tile Plastic 3D,depth 1 in are easy to install. appearing to possess the dimensions of height, width, and depth: creating the illusion of depth behind a flat surface Installation to a clean smooth surface with overlapping edges, design is actual size 24.25 x 24.25 to accommodate the 1/4 inch overlapping edge. Also available in standard Grid Size, 23.75 x 23.75 to allow you to glue to existing grid ceiling tile. Material: Rigid PVC (Poly Vinyl Chloride. Thickness: 0.50 mm Ceiling Tiles Class A Fire Rated. It is really quick and easy. 1. Prepare the surface: Wipe off the ceiling / surface and make it smooth and even. Remove loose plaster, paint, wall paper etc. 2. Center your room or Draw an angle: draw straight lines in the corner (in width and length part) and make a 90o angle, for starting point of pasting. 3. Apply the adhesive any good quality Contact Cement to a clean dry surface. 4. Place the sheet in the required position (first sheet at the 90o point) and press firmly. Long lasting & Durable Widest range to choose from Partly replaceable Colorable (Any good quality paint) No Fungus & Termite Effect Convenient Size. Washable (with mild detergent) Weatherproof Waterproof Light in weight Dustproof Recyclable Dimensional stable Easy, Quick & Low cost in fixing PVC Ceiling Tiles can be easily cut with Scissors In a Grid System or Suspended Ceiling our PVC Ceiling Tiles can be installed as an alternative using a support backing of plywood or similar item. We suggest when installing in a Grid, Suspended or Drop Ceiling System that it is a great idea to paint the grid after removal of any existing grid ceiling tile. We recommend painting the T-Bar or Grids with spray paint to match or coordinate to match your preferences. If your Suspended Ceiling system be in size 24 x 48 you might consider converting to a 24\"x 24\" Grid or glue two 24 x 24 to your 24 x 48 ceiling tile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+IdXeK1kL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Euro-Deco Ceilings, Inc.","source_asin":"B0040ZL6SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0040ZL6SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0040ZL6SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
