window.products.push({"id":1081761,"name":"Lady Pepperell Brigitte Floral Cotton Comforter Set, Twin/Twin XL.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919LI6o87fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by fantastical finds at vintage markets and yard sales, this comfy and cozy floral comforter set will put a playful spin on any décor. Whimsical red and white wildflowers bloom on a field of blue-green with Lady Pepperell’s Brigitte Floral Comforter Set, a print that gives your bedroom a fun and fresh touch. Fabricated in single-ply percale, each piece is comprised of 100% cotton for a cool, lightly textured feel. The comforter features exceptionally soft fill for snoozing that virtually never ends, while the silhouette of each sham is softened by contrasting white ruffled trims. Each Full/Queen and King set comes with one comforter and two shams. Twin/TwinXL sets include a comforter and a single sham. For a charming complement to this comforter set, pair it with the Lady Pepperell Odette floral bed sheets for a modern mix of prints destined to carry you to dreamland. The combination will give your space a twist that’s truly garden party ready. • Fabric is made of 100% cotton percale • Fill is made of 100% polyester • Shams are constructed with a center back overlap closure • Machine washable on cold cycle, tumble dry low • Imported from Pakistan • Sheets and pillows sold separately • Pair with the Lady Pepperell Odette Floral Sheet Set Dimensions Twin/Twin XL: Comforter: 66\"W x 94\"L;Sham: 20\"W x 26\"L","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919LI6o87fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lady Pepperell","source_asin":"B094F3CQ6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094F3CQ6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094F3CQ6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
