window.products.push({"id":1081862,"name":"7 Pieces Silicone Molds for Chocolate- Includes Letter Molds, Number Molds and candy molds silicone shapes- Easy to Use and simple to clean -Nonstick ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xApZrDcoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENJOY YOUR BAKING: Want to make treats that are as adorable as they are yummy? Baking is a fun activity that we all enjoy. When making desserts, how good they look is just as important as how great they taste. However, manually cutting up your dessert treats into unique shapes can be difficult and messy. Don’t worry about your trays melting while they're in the oven. Our product is made with thick and durable silicone that stays in shape, so your food bakes smoothly and evenly. KEY FEATURES: 1. Food-Grade Silicone Material 2. Reusable and Durable Molds 3. Easy to clean and store 4. Multi- Functional 5. Safe and Secure. Get CREATIVE WITH THESE MOLDS: Bakers, get creative with your hot chocolate molds. You can also melt chocolates, caramels, marshmallows, and cocoa into these half molds. The right coco ingredients will help you easily make delicious cake treats, molder, brownie, bombs or lava treats for your family. It can also be used to make candy and mini ice cream popsicles for kids. They are also freezer friendly and non-stick for easy release and cleaning! Use the free recipe eBook for even more treats. GREAT GIFT: V&M silicone mold is pretty and practical, so it can be the impressive gifts for you girlfriend, friends, mom, sisters and especially those people who like to DIY desserts. These small silicone molds are perfect for many parties and festivals as well, like birthday party, friend’s party, children's parties, Valentine day, Mother's Day, Children's day and more. REASONS TO BUY OUR PRODUCT: V&M molds box comes with 4 different designs for you to make scrumptious treats with. Use our alphabet molds to spell out a friend’s name or use the numerical ones to celebrate the birthday of someone in the family! You can even make semi-spherical or leaf-shaped cookies & candies. The round molds, in particular are perfect for the ever-trendy hot chocolate bombs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xApZrDcoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"V&M PRODUCT","source_asin":"B08TLK9NZ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TLK9NZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TLK9NZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
