window.products.push({"id":1081949,"name":"Ice Cube Tray, AiBast Ice Trays for Freezer With Lid, 3 Pack Silicone Large Round Ice Cube Tray, Sphere Square Honeycomb Ice Trays for Whiskey With Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q5dOXU85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔AiBast Safe Food Grade Silicone Ice Cube Tray -- Our silicone ice cube trays are made of 100% food-grade silicone which is BPA free, non-toxic, odorless, durable. Non-stick and easy release design make your drinking time much happier. Temperature resistance within - 104℉ to 446℉, you can make cocktails, cordials, liqueur, whiskeys, ice tea, iced coffee drinks, juices, and great for making popsicles, freezing sauces, baby food, and others what you like. Just enjoy your time! ✔6 Ice Balls Round Ice Cube Tray -- Round ice cube mold came with a small funnel and a measuring cup, just use them to inject the liquid you need to make perfect ice balls, each ball needs about 45 - 50 ml water. It produces 6 large balls with 1. 8 inches in diameter. Balls with big size melt slowly. Great ice tray for whiskey, cocktails, making popsicles, Ice cubes, pudding, biscuit cake, mousse, jelly, chocolate，ice cream, and what you like. ✔6 Ice Cubes Square Whiskey Ice Trays With Lid -- The square shape tray allows you to make 6 big ice cubes each time with the size 1. 8\" x 1. 8\" x 1. 8\", which help you make nice sized cubes easily. Just fill the trays with water/fruits/ ice cream/baby food/or anything you like(no more than 80%), and put them into the freezer. More than a novelty, they melt/dilute more slowly, ideal for chilling your Old Fashioned, Scotch Whiskey, Bourbon, or Blended Whiskey. ✔37 Ice Cube Honeycomb Ice Trays With Covers for Freezer -- Comes with a removable lid, the Honeycomb Shape Ice Tray allows the space-saving storage set to fit nicely in any home refrigerator, RV, or dorm mini-fridge and keeps ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. There are 37 small grids for each silicone ice grid, which can make ice cubes with different flavors/fruit ice/yogurt/baby food, etc. ✔Buyer After-Sale Service -- This 3 pack AiBast Ice Cube Trays are designed by experienced engineers and crafted with the premium materials. Each order comes with the best after-sales service, it means if you have any issues with this product you could contact us for solutions, we will give you the best shopping experience without any worries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q5dOXU85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AiBast","source_asin":"B08XWJRJBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XWJRJBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XWJRJBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
