window.products.push({"id":1081989,"name":"Asian Village People at River ~ Rattan Scroll Picture Asian Art Ratan Decor Feng Shui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711oD2hyDpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rattan scrolls are a kind of artistic work done by painting on rattan, which is made by weaving hundreds of very thin strips of bamboo and/or cane together making a wonderful backdrop for these unique paintings. These are very popular collectibles and home decoration articles in Asian countries. This rattan scroll is weighted with a wooden dowel on the bottom. It is specially finished for Oriental antique accent. Overall Measurements H 30\" x W 12\" - Painted Area H 24\" x W 11\" Be surrounded and inspired by peace and joy. Be open to new cultures and customs and embrace differences. Blend the beauty and tranquility of Asian art and decor into your lifestyle. These Make Wonderful Gifts !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711oD2hyDpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asian Imports","source_asin":"B00I8W2Q36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I8W2Q36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I8W2Q36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
