window.products.push({"id":1081994,"name":"GARCENT Macaron Silicone Mat, Non-stick Silicon Pastry Baking Mold Set of 2, Cookie Half Sheet Kit with Oil Brush, Silicone Spatula, Food Tongs, Cake ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EefIAESlL._AC_SL1057_.jpg","description":"In the baking world, once you touch, you will be addicted to it. Try to collecting different kinds utensils, try to creating pastry with all different kinds of ingredients. Control the weight temperature and cooking time, different manufacture working procedure, there are all kinds of things we can do in the kitchen and give us an enjoyable holiday activity. Here, Garcent will bring you into the macaron baking world. Warning & Tips (1)Macarons are decently difficult to make, requires more patience, skill and take some practices to get right. If you have no experience with a silicone pastry molds, please read some tips below:(2)You could find some recipe online or YouTube to make the batter. If you want to master it faster, we suggest you buy a french macaron book that it can give you very precise instructions and tips.(2) Put the silicone mat onto baking sheet for both piping and baking. (3) Make sure to lightly spray the mat before piping, you could also using adusting of powdered sugar, it would help reduce sticking. (4) Adjust the cooking time, compared to parchment paper, the silicone baking mat requires a longer bake time. (5) Please don’t pulling them too soon, wait and let them cool completely before removing from the mold. (6) About clean: Soak in hot water for about a few minutes, wipe away everything with a sponge and dishwashing liquid. Package Contents 2 x large mats (11-5/8\" x16-1/2\")1 x Oil Brush1 x Silicone Spatula1 x Food Tongs 1 x Piping bag with 6 Nozzles for decorating Please Click \"Add to Cart\" , Buy it at Uncle Martin Store Now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EefIAESlL._AC_SL1057_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GARCENT","source_asin":"B07Q6PB4LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1081994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q6PB4LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q6PB4LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
